<title>GERMANY: Traub shares suspended before announcement.</title>
<headline>Traub shares suspended before announcement.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German machine tool-maker Traub AG were suspended on Tuesday ahead of an expected announcement, the Stuttgart bourse said.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the Frankfurt bourse confirmed that the suspension also applied on Germany's largest stock market.</p>
<p>Traub earlier this month announced plans to file for bankruptcy. The group has also been cited as a possible candidate for takeover.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
